{"id":"vod_sn_35641","vodId":"35641","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"猫神八百万","name_cn":"猫神八百万","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b918913266d3c022b3c11d6fc14580c8.jpg"},"summary":"由于父母双亡，年纪轻轻的古宫柚子（堀江由衣 配音）成为了古董店八百万堂的老板娘，虽然无依无靠，但有着茧（户松遥 配音）的陪伴，柚子并不觉得孤单。茧并不是人类，而是一只寄居在店里的猫神，专门守护被人们遗忘的记忆。　　在茧的召唤下，各路神灵开始在八百万堂内聚集。个性单纯天真可爱的樱神芳乃（斋藤千和 配音），虽为女性但和茧有着结婚约定的正仓院笹鸣（茅野爱衣 配音）以及爱慕着柚子但有些害羞的狐神弓太（三瓶由布子 配音）。这些神仙虽然有着神奇的能力，但个性上却都有着天然呆的一面。在打打闹闹中，八百万堂新的一天又开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":19,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VGY47nW67t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cpVGnKddK41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SySDZH3S2i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JkvKFpBWTK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ig9hutue301/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/suYRzucYHF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4EnuLvFueU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bUcpezMgmQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FSWWp01pVw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zyDuTx2Hzu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qKxJ7vH1UK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NPwRTAt5JC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EXeRYgviVS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GyAEPY911K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/